peInfo_unit__wsQZv">g</span></span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class="RecipeInfo_annotation___Zz57"><div class="AnnotationButton_container__fyxLw "><span class="AnnotationButton_icon__hIfcM">!</span><div class="AnnotationButton_textContent__evJju"><span>表示はすべて目安です。また、栄養価はNadia AIの自動計算による推定値です。<!-- --> </span><button class="AnnotationButton_linkText__NNciq">詳しくはこちら</button></div></div></div><span style="display:block;width:20px;min-width:20px;height:20px;min-height:20px"></span></div><div class="pc_box__Jz4b1"><div class="RecipeDesc_box__rsueU"><p>ちゃちゃっと5分で作れるレンチン簡単サラダ🍅
子供の食いつきが最高でした・・・！
ポン酢を使っているのでさっぱりと食べれますよー✨</p></div></div></section></div><div class="pc_wrap__986n9"><section><div class="pc_box__Jz4b1"><h2 class="RecipeHeading_heading__3D0K1">材料<span class="RecipeHeading_bunryoYield__678kz">2人分</span></h2><span style="display:block;width:20px;min-width:20px;height:20px;min-height:20px"></span><ul class="IngredientsList_list___ZKVF"><li><div class="IngredientsList_group__3dWj1"></div><div class="IngredientsList_ingredient__QAVLf">ほうれん草</div><div class="IngredientsList_amount__UO68W">1パック</div></li><li><div class="IngredientsList_group__3dWj1"></div><div class="IngredientsList_ingredient__QAVLf">ミニトマト</div><div class="IngredientsList_amount__UO68W">5〜6個</div></li><li><div class="IngredientsList_group__3dWj1"></div><div class="IngredientsList_ingredient__QAVLf">ツナ缶</div><div class="IngredientsList_amount__UO68W">1缶</div></li><li><div class="IngredientsList_group__3dWj1"><span>A</span></div><div class="IngredientsList_ingredient__QAVLf">ポン酢</div><div class="IngredientsList_amount__UO68W">大さじ1</div></li><li><div class="IngredientsList_group__3dWj1"><span>A</span></div><div class="IngredientsList_ingredient__QAVLf">中華だし</div><div class="IngredientsList_amount__UO68W">小さじ1</div></li></ul><div class="IngredientsList_cookingSafety__Ckf80"><div class="AnnotationButton_container__fyxLw "><span class="AnnotationButton_icon__hIfcM">!</span><div class="AnnotationButton_textContent__evJju"><a href="/cooking-safety" class="AnnotationButton_linkText__NNciq">安全に料理をするための注意事項</a></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class="pc_wrap__986n9"><section><div class="pc_box__Jz4b1"><h2 class="RecipeHeading_heading__3D0K1">作り方</h2><span style="display:block;width:20px;min-width:20px;height:20px;min-height:20px"></span><ul class="CookingProcess_list__ytG9U"><li><div class="CookingProcess_group__LTga6"><span>1</span></div><div class="CookingProcess_textBox__LFCXe"><p class="CookingProcess_text__1_UFV"><span>ほうれん草をよく洗い、2〜3cm程の長さに切り分ける。</span></p><div class="CookingProcess_processImage__o3rSP"><img src="https://asset.oceans-nadia.com/upload/save_image/24/24aa8f1a62271b3e3a8be1a681016f82.jpg?impolicy=cropwm&amp;w=100&amp;h=100" srcSet="https://asset.oceans-nadia.com/upload/save_image/24/24aa8f1a62271b3e3a8be1a681016f82.jpg?impolicy=cropwm&amp;w=100&amp;h=100 1x,https://asset.oceans-nadia.com/upload/save_image/24/24aa8f1a62271b3e3a8be1a681016f82.jpg?impolicy=cropwm&amp;w=200&amp;h=200 2x" alt="【お子が爆食❤️】ほうれん草とトマトのレンチンツナサラダの工程1" width="100" height="100" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div></div></li><li><div class="CookingProcess_group__LTga6"><span>2</span></div><div class="CookingProcess_textBox__LFCXe"><p class="CookingProcess_text__1_UFV"><span>耐熱容器にほうれん草を加えふんわりラップをし、電子レンジで3分加熱する。

加熱後ほうれん草を絞り、しっかり水気を切っておく。</span></p><div class="CookingProcess_processImage__o3rSP"><img src="https://asset.oceans-nadia.com/upload/save_image/f5/f55db359252aa1e9703b115360b3abd6.jpg?impolicy=cropwm&amp;w=100&amp;h=100" srcSet="https://asset.oceans-nadia.com/upload/save_image/f5/f55db359252aa1e9703b115360b3abd6.jpg?impolicy=cropwm&amp;w=100&amp;h=100 1x,https://asset.oceans-nadia.com/upload/save_image/f5/f55db359252aa1e9703b115360b3abd6.jpg?impolicy=cropwm&amp;w=200&amp;h=200 2x" alt="【お子が爆食❤️】ほうれん草とトマトのレンチンツナサラダの工程2" width="100" height="100" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div></div></li><li><div class="CookingProcess_group__LTga6"><span>3</span></div><div class="CookingProcess_textBox__LFCXe"><p class="CookingProcess_text__1_UFV"><span>ミニトマトのヘタを取り、半分に<a href="/wordlist/輪切り">輪切り</a>にする。</span></p><div class="CookingProcess_processImage__o3rSP"><img src="https://asset.oceans-nadia.com/upload/save_image/cd/cd45bc0b0bcccdf8d5a129648dc2fda0.jpg?impolicy=cropwm&amp;w=100&amp;h=100" srcSet="https://asset.oceans-nadia.com/upload/save_image/cd/cd45bc0b0bcccdf8d5a129648dc2fda0.jpg?impolicy=cropwm&amp;w=100&amp;h=100 1x,https://asset.oceans-nadia.com/upload/save_image/cd/cd45bc0b0bcccdf8d5a129648dc2fda0.jpg?impolicy=cropwm&amp;w=200&amp;h=200 2x" alt="【お子が爆食❤️】ほうれん草とトマトのレンチンツナサラダの工程3" width="100" height="100" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div></div></li><li><div class="CookingProcess_group__LTga6"><span>4</span></div><div class="CookingProcess_textBox__LFCXe"><p class="CookingProcess_text__1_UFV"><span>ほうれん草、ミニトマト、ツナ缶と<span style='color:#af8728; font-weight:bold;'>A </span><span style='background-color:#f2e6cf; font-weight:bold;'>ポン酢大さじ1、中華だし小さじ1</span>を混ぜ合わせる。</span></p><div class="CookingProcess_processImage__o3rSP"><img src="https://asset.oceans-nadia.com/upload/save_image/70/7095daf8e6574a284a4bf36bcc1b3be7.jpg?impolicy=cropwm&amp;w=100&amp;h=100" srcSet="https://asset.oceans-nadia.com/upload/save_image/70/7095daf8e6574a284a4bf36bcc1b3be7.jpg?impolicy=cropwm&amp;w=100&amp;h=100 1x,https://asset.oceans-nadia.com/upload/save_image/70/7095daf8e6574a284a4bf36bcc1b3be7.jpg?impolicy=cropwm&amp;w=200&amp;h=200 2x" alt="【お子が爆食❤️】ほうれん草とトマトのレンチンツナサラダの工程4" width="100" height="100" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div></div></li></ul></div></section></div><div class="pc_wrap__986n9"><section><div class="pc_box__Jz4b1"><h2 class="RecipeHeading_heading__3D0K1">ポイント</h2><span style="display:block;width:20px;min-width:20px;height:20px;min-height:20px"></span><p class="RecipePoint_text__bBRBt">※ツナ缶は油ごと入れてます、苦手な方は油を切ってください。</p></div></section><section><div class="pc_box__Jz4b1"><span style="display:block;width:20px;min-width:20px;height:20px;min-height:20px"></span><div class="RelatedBasics_box__FVJfy"><div class="swiper" id="relatedBasicsSwiper"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide"><a href="/cooking_basics/191"><div><img src="https://asset.oceans-nadia.com/upload/save_image/3c/3c599c4c0066a9638aa36a66f9acdd5f_20220531193629.jpg?impolicy=crop&amp;w=200&amp;h=200" srcSet="https://asset.oceans-nadia.com/upload/save_image/3c/3c599c4c0066a9638aa36a66f9acdd5f_20220531193629.jpg?impolicy=crop&amp;w=200&amp;h=200 1x,https://asset.oceans-nadia.com/upload/save_image/3c/3c599c4c0066a9638aa36a66f9acdd5f_20220531193629.jpg?impolicy=crop&amp;w=400&amp;h=400 2x" alt="ほうれん草のざく切り" width="200" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><p class="RelatedBasics_title__oPkGM">ほうれん草のざく切り</p></div></a></div><div class="swiper-slide"><a href="/cooking_basics/192"><div><img src="https://asset.oceans-nadia.com/upload/save_image/13/132b93b51e927707948cc3506d928f60_20220531193838.jpg?impolicy=crop&amp;w=200&amp;h=200" srcSet="https://asset.oceans-nadia.com/upload/save_image/13/132b93b51e927707948cc3506d928f60_20220531193838.jpg?impolicy=crop&amp;w=200&amp;h=200 1x,https://asset.oceans-nadia.com/upload/save_image/13/132b93b51e927707948cc3506d928f60_20220531193838.jpg?impolicy=crop&amp;w=400&amp;h=400 2x" alt="ほうれん草のゆで方" width="200" height="200" lo